    "notes": [
      "Blunt Force Trauma's damage is treated as basic damage but also triggers spell effects by also being tagged as spell damage, while the target's body being shoved deals area damage to enemies it passes through.\n  - The basic attack is also considered a part of Blunt Force Trauma and treated as both basic damage and spell damage.",
      "Blunt Force Trauma's attack works against structures, consuming the buff and dealing its full damage.",
      "Blunt Force Trauma cannot knock back wards, structures, epic monsters, Tentacles and W it kills, nor champions that enter a zombie state upon dying.\n  - Plants and W can be flung.",
      "Targets flung away are rendered untargetable in the process.",
      "The damage of the enemy's corpse colliding with enemies does not benefit from Blunt Force Trauma's attack critically striking."
